# NODE-PATH-ANON-STRUCT (steps/defects.md; an OPEN positive, red by design): Model's code reads node\h\p, a field of
# h, an anonymous Structure of the root's body.  `node\name` names a value field of the body of the lexical parent
# (book §3), and h is one; the translator refuses the path at `node` ("unknown field path segment": the own
# field scan maps no Structure field without a recorded type), at HEAD too.  Exit 7: b's k is h's p, 3.
h:
    int: p 3
    int: q 4
Model:
    int: k 0
    k: node\h\p
end: Model
b: merge: Model
b
int: ok 7
if: b\k != 3
    ok: 81
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
